### Users – variabili
@baseUrl      = http://localhost:3000
@studentToken = STUDENT_JWT_TOKEN

# NOTA: UsersController espone solo GET /users/me e PATCH /users/me.
# L'userId viene estratto dal JWT — nessun :id nel path per sicurezza.
# JwtAuthGuard attualmente commentato nel controller, da decommentare
# quando AuthModule sarà implementato.

# ─── GET /users/me ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Get profilo utente autenticato
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 2. Get profilo – senza token (atteso 401 quando guard attivo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

# ─── PATCH /users/me ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. Update profilo – tutti i campi modificabili
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "first_name": "Mario",
  "last_name": "Rossi",
  "birth_date": "1992-06-15",
  "country": "ITALY"
}

### 4. Update profilo – solo first_name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "first_name": "Luigi"
}

### 5. Update profilo – solo country
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "country": "GERMANY"
}

# ─── Edge cases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Update – country non valida (atteso 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "country": "MARS"
}

### 7. Update – birth_date formato errato (atteso 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "birth_date": "non-una-data"
}

### 8. Update – tentativo di cambiare email (ignorato dal DTO/atteso 400)
# email è esclusa da UpdateUserDto — il campo verrà ignorato o rifiutato
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "email": "hacker@evil.com",
  "first_name": "Test"
}

### 9. Update – tentativo di cambiare role (ignorato dal DTO/atteso 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}
